## Installation

Requires Python >= 3.13 and [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/).

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd {{ project_name }}
uv sync
```

## Usage

```bash
uv run {{ _project_slug }}
```

## Development

```bash
# Run tests
uv run pytest

# Lint and format
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format .

# Type check
uv run pyright

# Check import layering
uv run lint-imports

# Install pre-commit hooks
uv run pre-commit install
```
